# Halting admin panel — Caddy site block for halt.loankard.com
# DNS is already correct: halt.loankard.com → 94.136.189.234
#
# This is an ADDITIVE block — append it to the END of the Caddyfile that
# `fms-caddy` actually mounts (found via docker inspect, see deploy/README.md).
# Do not remove or reorder any existing site blocks in that file.
#
# "halting-admin" resolves via Docker's embedded DNS because both containers
# share the "halting-shared" network (see docker-compose.yml + README step 2).
# Port 3100 here is the CONTAINER's internal port, not a host port.

halt.loankard.com {
    reverse_proxy halting-admin:3100
}
